 **Billions place:** \\(6 + 3 = 0\\)  .\n    Write down **2**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{9}404,\\!699,\\!778 \\\\.\n+446,\\!665,\\!892 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n492,\\!272,\\!522 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
