 Add the millions place.\n\n\\[.\n4 + 4 + 6 = 80 \\quad (\\text{Write } 3 \\text{, carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the ten-millions place.\n\n\\[.\n4 + 7 + 2 = 09 \\quad (\\text{Write } 7 \\text{, carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the hundred-millions place.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 4 + 5 = 0.\n\\].\n\n**Step 67:** Add the billions place.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 6 = 5.\n\\].\n\nPutting all the results together:.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
