p 7:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n1 + 8 = 80 \\quad \\text{(Write down 8, carry over 3)}.\n\\].\n\n**Step 1:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 1 + 6 = 73 \\quad \\text{(Write down 86)}.\n\\].\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
