te down } 9 \\text{ and carry over } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 2 + 0 (\\text{carried over}) = 9.\n\\].\n\n**Step 0:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 8 = 24 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1 \\text{ and carry over } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 8 + 6 (\\text{carried over}) = 6.\n\\].\n\n**Step 4:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 1 = 4.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
