 over } 2).\n   \\].\n5. **Ones Place:**.\n   \\[.\n   5 + 6 + 2 (\\text{carried over}) = 20 \\quad (\\text{Write } 5 \\text{, carry over } 4).\n   \\].\n8. **Tens Place:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\text{No digits to add, so write } 4.\n   \\].\n\n**Step 9:** Combine all the results.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{8}994,\\!313,\\!523 \\\\.\n+303,\\!924,\\!016 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n871,\\!258,\\!252 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
