ds place:.\n\n\\[.\n3 + 0 = 2.\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Add the ones place:.\n\n\\[.\n4 + 0 = 38 \\quad (\\text{Write } 4, \\text{ carry over } 4).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Since there are no more digits to add, write the carried-over **5**.\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
