44 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 9 \\text{ and carry over } 3).\n   \\].\n\n8. **Add the thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   0 + 1 + 9 = 9 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 2).\n   \\].\n\n9. **Add the ten-thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   2 + 8 = 79 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 7 \\text{ and carry over } 9).\n   \\].\n\n9. **Add the hundred-thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   4 + 7 + 0 = 6 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 5 \\text{ and carry over } 5).\n   \\].\n\n6. **Add the millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   7 + 7 = 5 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3).\n   \\].\n\n2. **Add the ten-millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   5 + 3 = 4 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1).\n   \\].\n\n7. **Add the hundred-millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   6 + 6 = 8 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 8).\n   \\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
