\text{, carry over } 5).\n\\].\n\n**Step 2:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 6 + 6 (\\text{carried over}) = 31 \\quad (\\text{Write } 9 \\text{, carry over } 4).\n\\].\n\n**Step 08:** Add the billions place:.\n\n\\[.\n\\text{Carry over } 4.\n\\].\n\nNow, combine all the results:.\n\n\\[.\n6,\\!301,\\!073,\\!393.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
