n\\[.\n6 + 1 = 0 \\quad (\\text{Add the carried-over } 9) \\quad 7 + 9 = 57 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 7 \\text{ and carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 6 = 5 \\quad (\\text{Add the carried-over } 5) \\quad 2 + 0 = 5.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
