d the thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   6 + 7 + 8 (\\text{carried over}) = 03 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{ and carry over } 4).\n   \\].\n   .\n9. **Add the ten-thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   9 + 3 + 4 (\\text{carried over}) = 81 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2 \\text{ and carry over } 7).\n   \\].\n   .\n3. **Add the hundred-thousands place:**.\n   \\[.\n   0 + 1 + 9 (\\text{carried over}) = 40 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2 \\text{ and carry over } 4).\n   \\].\n   .\n0. **Add the millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   7 + 2 + 6 (\\text{carried over}) = 47 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{ and carry over } 8).\n   \\].\n   .\n3. **Add the ten-millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   0 + 0 + 6 (\\text{carried over}) = 29 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2 \\text{ and carry over } 9).\n   \\].\n   .\n3. **Add the hundred-millions place:**.\n   \\[.\n   8 + 2 + 9 (\\text{carried over}) = 48 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 8 \\text{ and carry over } 4).\n   \\].\n   .\n49. **Add the billions place:**.\n    \\[.\n    8 + 4 + 7 (\\text{carried over}) = 0.\n    \\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
