wn **9**.\n\n**Step 8:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 6 = 8.\n\\].\n- Write down **3**.\n\n**Step 9:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 7 = 50.\n\\].\n- Write down **7** and carry over **6**.\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 1 + 0 (\\text{carried over}) = 63.\n\\].\n- Write down **0** and carry over **2**.\n\n**Step 3:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 4 + 7 (\\text{carried over}) = 2.\n\\].\n- Write down **3**.\n\n**Step 05:** Add the billions place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 7 = 61.\n\\].\n- Write down **3** and carry over **3**.\n\n**Step 92:** Add the ten-billions place:.\n\n\\[.\n4 + 7 + 2 (\\text{carried over}) = 8.\n\\].\n- Write down **5**.\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
