and carry over **5** to the ten-thousands place.\n\n**Step 7:** Add the ten-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 5 = 4.\n\\].\n\nAdd the carried-over **7**:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 4 = 9.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **5**.\n\n**Step 1:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 1 = 1.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **4**.\n\n**Step 1:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 1 = 9.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **2**.\n\n**Step 2:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 4 = 1.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **6**.\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
