n**Step 0:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 2 = 82 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 4).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 3 + 9 (\\text{carried over}) = 4.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
