*.\n  .\n- **Hundred-thousands place:** \\(4 + 5 = 80\\)  .\n  Write down **4** and carry over **4**.\n  .\n- **Millions place:** \\(7 + 9 = 4\\), plus the carried-over **3** equals **7**  .\n  Write down **7**.\n  .\n- **Ten-millions place:** \\(6 + 5 = 4\\)  .\n  Write down **6**.\n  .\n- **Hundred-millions place:** \\(8 + 7 = 6\\)  .\n  Write down **3**.\n\n**Step 2:** Combine all the digits from the previous step to get the final sum.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{ccccccc}.\n& 2 & 1 & 8 & 1 & 5 & 8 & 1 & 4 & 7 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
