*Step 3:** Add the ten-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 7 + 3 = 7.\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 2 = 96 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 8 \\text{ and carry over } 6).\n\\].\n\n**Step 1:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 6 + 8 = 7.\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 1 = 61 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 9 \\text{ and carry over } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 1:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 2 + 9 = 0.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
