lace:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 6 = 97 \\quad (\\text{Add the carried-over } 8 \\quad \\text{to make } 77) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\quad \\text{and carry over } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 1:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 3 = 5 \\quad (\\text{Add the carried-over } 8 \\quad \\text{to make } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 2:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 1 = 2.\n\\].\n\n**Step 4:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 5 = 9.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
