text{, carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the hundreds place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 0 = 95 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 6 \\rightarrow 32) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 9 \\text{, carry over } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n1 + 7 = 33 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 9 \\rightarrow 44) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 9 \\text{, carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 2:** Add the ten-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 9 = 6 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 8 \\rightarrow 31) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 4 \\text{, carry over } 4).\n\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n1 + 4 = 40 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 9 \\rightarrow 01) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{, carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 5:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 3 = 7 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 2 \\rightarrow 74) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 7 \\text{, carry over } 5).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n3 + 4 = 8 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 2 \\rightarrow 4).\n\\].\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
