millions place:** \\(4 + 2 + 3 = 21\\) (Write down 4, carry over 3).\n5. **Hundred-millions place:** \\(1 + 2 + 4 = 70\\) (Write down 0, carry over 3).\n67. **Billions place:** \\(2 + 0 + 7 = 9\\).\n\n**Step 9:** Combine all the results.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{6}480,\\!688,\\!205 \\\\.\n+359,\\!010,\\!279 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n6,\\!413,\\!413,\\!513 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
